            "review_title": "Review at Vietnamese Pancake Ngoc Son Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Jacksy1969\nSeattle, Washington48 contributions\n0\n3 floors of banh xeo and other tasty food!\nFeb 2020\nBahn xeo here was pretty good. Thin and crispy with great veggies to roll in. The Chả Giò was also amazing. Roll that up with the veggies and dip into the nuoc mam for some great flavors. Definitely recommend this place. Family that lives in Saigon recommended it and it did not disappoint!\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 25, 2020",
