            "review_title": "Review at Vietnamese Pancake Ngoc Son Restaurant",
            "review_text": "MaxManila\nManila, Philippines3292 contributions\n0\nViet Pancake\nJan 2020 • Family\nOne of the popular street foods which you shouldn’t miss when you visit Vietnam for the first time. Banh xeo refers to sizzling pancake which contains different ingredients including pork, shrimp, onion, bean sprouts, mung beans. \n\nWe tasted the southern type of banh xeo which is basically wrapped in lettuce or mustard leaf, and mixed with other fresh leaves like mint, basil and fish mint. Then, it is dipped in their local sauce before eating. \n\nMy family loved this Viet specialty that we had to go back to this resto on our last night in HCMC. It is served with a basket of fresh greens for wrapping and dipping.\n\nNice taste of culture thru food.\nRead more\nWritten January 5, 2020",
