            "review_text": "Natnayas\nHaldia, India88 contributions\n0\nGreat authentic Banh Xeo\nMar 2019 • Couples\nAt first felt a bit eerie to eat here with so many local people. Came here withvtwo University students as a part of back of the bike tours. They taught us how to eat a Banh Xeo, thoroughly enjoyed the food and the experience.\nWritten March 25, 2019",
