            "review_title": "Review at Vietnamese Pancake Ngoc Son Restaurant",
            "review_text": "fiestychef\nBrooklyn, New York125 contributions\n0\nGreat banh xeo, affordable price, lots of seating\nDec 2018 • Friends\nwe came here as part of a food tour with two local university students. since we tried the standard size banh xeo at another restaurant, we opted to try the 'mini' ones here. everything on the tables looked fresh. we enjoyed our mini pancakes but then my bf had fomo that we didn't try the standard banh xeo there (we wanted to save room for the other spots on the tour). service is fast and the spot is very casual. highly recommend!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten December 28, 2018",
