            "review_text": "TravelEatXplore\nBoston, Massachusetts5204 contributions\n0\nMust try giant Banh Xeo!\nMar 2017 • Friends\nIf you are in Ho Chi Minh and want authentic Banh Xeo, come here. The Banh Xeo is huge! The banh xeo is flavorful, the outer edge of the banh xeo is crispy. You can get one with everything or they can make it to your needs. One giant banh xeo is 65,000 VND. They all have deep fried spring rolls which is really good too. They do serve beers.\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 26, 2017",
